<title>UK: ASDA yr pretax profits, sales rise.</title>
<headline>ASDA yr pretax profits, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending May 3</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) (basic)    10.66		  vs 7.96</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.24		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 3.05		   vs 2.65</p>
<p> Pretax		     405.2		  vs 311.5</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-excepts    353.7		  vs (up 16.1 pct)</p>
<p> Turnover		   6,952.2		vs 6,042.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 344.0 and 355.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - ASDA Group Plc</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
